| us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6, anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6, anthropic.claude-haiku-4-5-20251001-v1:0 | none |
| anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6-v1:0, xx.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6 | "Unknown model" and guessed limits (200K context, 16000 max tokens) |
| anthropic.claude-opus-4-7, anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-7, anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929-v1:0, anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-20250514-v1:0 | guessed limits only |

The last row is #1121 item 2: yoagent 0.27.2 did not fix those four, and I didn't touch them. I posted a comment on #1121 whose first 200 characters say item 2 is what's still open, followed by the details and the /cost leftover.
